# "{1}{W}{B}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Create an X/X white Spirit creature token, where X is the greatest toughness
# among creatures you control. Activate only as a sorcery." Bot1 casts the Monument on turn 1 beside a Memnite (1/1) and an
# Ornithopter (0/2); on turn 3 four Moxen pay, and the Spirit is 2/2 - the greatest toughness (not the greatest power, not
# the sum), the Monument sacrificed as a cost. It is refused on the opponent's turn 2, when Bot2 casts a Phyrexian Walker
# (0/3): a creature Bot1 does not control, so its toughness 3 is not counted.

